Package: SAboinETB
Type: Package
Title: Similarity-Adaptive BOIN Designs for Basket Dose Optimization
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: person("SA-BOIN-ETB", "Development Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "haohaostats@users.noreply.github.com")
Author: haohaostats [aut, cre]
Maintainer: haohaostats <haohaostats@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Prospective design, interim analysis, borrowing diagnostics, and
    final dose selection for similarity-adaptive Bayesian optimal interval
    basket trials with joint toxicity and efficacy endpoints. The package
    provides safety-gated, endpoint-specific borrowing with explicit borrowed
    effective sample-size limits and audit-ready decision outputs.
